{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20116","headline":"张徐州席送岑秀才 · 孟郊","name":"张徐州席送岑秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"振振芝兰步，升自君子堂。\n泠泠松桂吟，生自楚客肠。\n羇鸟无定栖，惊蓬在他乡。\n去兹门馆闲，即彼道路长。\n雨余山川净，麦熟草木凉。\n楚泪滴章句，京尘染衣裳。\n赠君无余佗，久要不可忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}